```

Add `"yellow"` to the end of the list.

---

### Exercise 5: Insert an Item

Given:

```python
animals = ["cat", "dog", "rabbit"]
```

Insert `"lion"` at index `1`.

---

### Exercise 6: Remove an Item

Given:

```python
